3GPP TSG-RAN3 Meeting #114-e R3-214700 Electronic meeting, 1- 11 November 2021 3GPP TSG-RAN WG4 Meeting # 100-e R4-2115067 Electronic Meeting, August 16-27, 2021 Title: LS on Inclusive Language Review Status and Consistency Check Response to: - Release: Release 17 Work Item: Source: TSG RAN WG4 To: TSG RAN Cc: TSG RAN WG2, TSG RAN WG3 Contact Person: Muhammad Kazmi Muhammad.Kazmi@ericsson.com Attachments: - 1 Overall description RAN4 would like to inform RAN about the following outcome of the inclusive language review of all the RAN4 specifications: In RAN4 only TS 36.133 was identified to have the inclusive language issue. The Rel-17 CR in R4-2103254 to correct the inclusive language was agreed at RAN4#98-e and approved at the RAN#91e. The RRM procedures related to requirements in TS 36.133 involving inclusive language are defined in corresponding RAN2 specifications. The corrected language/terms in TS 36.133 (based on CR in R4-2103254) are the same as used in the RAN2 specification defining the corresponding RRM procedures. Therefore, no Rel-17 RAN4 specification contains any non-inclusive language or inclusive language terms that are not consistent with those used in other RAN WGs. 2 Actions To TSG RAN ACTION: RAN4 respectfully asks RAN to take account RAN4 feedback on the inclusive language and consistency check. 3 Dates of next TSG-RAN WG4 meetings TSG-RAN4 Meeting#101-e November 1-12, 2021, Electronic Meeting

